{"url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/data-sweeper-disk-cleaner/id6760408045?mt=12","title":"‎Data Sweeper: Disk Cleaner App - App Store","text":"for Mac \nSearch\nDiscover\nArcade\nCreate\nWork\nPlay\nDevelop\nCategories\nCategories\nCategories\nProductivity\nUtilities\nPhoto & Video\nGames\nBusiness\nEducation\nMusic\nSocial Networking\nData Sweeper: Disk Cleaner\n\nClean system data & junk\n\nOnly for Mac\n\n$9.99\n\nView in Mac App Store\nAGE RATING\n4+\nYears\nCATEGORY\nUtilities\nDEVELOPER\ncharles binet\nLANGUAGE\nEN\nEnglish\nSIZE\n2.4\nMB\nMac\n\nTake back your Mac's storage in minutes. DataSweeper finds system data, large & duplicate files, and space-wasting clutter, then safely moves them to your macOS Trash where you can review before permanent deletion. No subscriptions. No accounts. No data leaves your Mac.\n\nFOUR POWERFUL SCANNERS\n• System Data: Find bloated caches, old logs, and temporary files your system no longer needs.\n• Duplicate Finder: SHA-256 hash matching finds exact duplicates across your drive. No false positives.\n• Large Files: Discover forgotten downloads, old archives, and oversized files eating your storage.\n• Junk Files: Clean up old installers, broken downloads, and leftover app data.\n\nSAFE BY DESIGN\nEvery file goes to your macOS Trash first, nothing is permanently deleted. A built-in safety system color-codes each file (safe / caution / risky) so you always know what you're removing. Critical system files, keychains, and SSH keys are automatically protected and cannot be deleted.\nFull undo support: changed your mind? One click restores files from the Trash back to their original location.\n\nPRIVACY FIRST\nDataSweeper makes zero network connections. No analytics, no telemetry, no accounts, no tracking.\nEverything runs 100% on your Mac. Your files are your business.\n\nWORKS WITH SIRI & SHORTCUTS\nUse voice commands or automate cleanup with Siri Shortcuts.\n\nONE PRICE. NO SUBSCRIPTIONS.\nPay once, use forever. No monthly fees, no premium tiers, no upsells. Every feature is included from day one.\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\n• Native macOS app built with SwiftUI\n• iCloud-aware: detects cloud-only files to prevent unnecessary downloads\n• Dark & light mode support\n• Background scan notifications\n• Keyboard shortcuts for power users (Delete key, Cmd+Z undo)\nmore\n\nRatings & Reviews\nThis app hasn’t received enough ratings or reviews to display an overview.\nWhat’s New\n\nImproved scanners\nBug fixes\nCosmetic fixes\n\nVersion 1.0.8\nSep 12\nApp Privacy\n\nThe developer, charles binet, indicated that the app’s privacy practices may include handling of data as described below. For more information, see the developer’s privacy policy .\n\nData Not Collected\n\nThe developer does not collect any data from this app.\n\nPrivacy practices may vary, for example, based on the features you use or your age. Learn More\n\nAccessibility\n\nThe developer has not yet indicated which accessibility features this app supports. Learn More\n\nInformation\nSeller\ncharles binet\nSize\n2.4 MB\nCategory\nUtilities\nCompatibility\nRequires macOS 26.2 or later. \nLanguages\nEnglish\nAge Rating\n4+ \nCopyright\n© 2026 Charles Binet\nDeveloper Website\nPrivacy Policy\nSupports\nFamily Sharing\n\nUp to six family members can use this app with Family Sharing enabled.\n\nMore by charles binet\nView\nMine Squad: Minesweeper\nPlay. Solve. Clear real mines.\nUnited States\nEspañol (México)\nالعربية\nРусский\n简体中文\nFrançais (France)\n한국어\nPortuguês (Brazil)\nTiếng Việt\n繁體中文 (台灣)\n\nCopyright © 2026 Apple Inc. All rights reserved.\n\nInternet Service Terms\nApp Store & Privacy\nCookie Warning\nSupport","images":[{"alt":"","src":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/69/0d/e4/690de499-46ff-65a7-8988-da6f451a2283/Placeholder.mill/400x400Icon.ApSmac01-75.webp","width":200,"height":200},{"alt":"","src":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/69/0d/e4/690de499-46ff-65a7-8988-da6f451a2283/Pla